  "slug": "cranberry-rum-punch",
  "name": "Cranberry Rum Punch",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "Ginger ale gives this potent punch a favorite fizz; a generous dose of white sugar sweetens up the mix.",
